    "Details": "A monster of a unit, these heavily armed vehicles are the epitome of the Tank.  Line breakers and fire support platforms, these are usually found in the front of an attack. Carrying an array of ranged weapons, the Assault Tank is designed to smash targets at range.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Heavy Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       265     50\n<b>Left</b>         185     50\n<b>Right</b>       185     50\n<b>Rear</b>        130     50\n<b>Turret</b>      265     50\n\n<b>Total</b>      1030    250</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Main Battle Tank</color>",
